== Walkthrough ==

''[[Depnar Bulrious]] is located at -643, -41 in the Temple of Divine Light ([[Cleric]] and [[Paladin]]) Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Depnar Bulrious'

: Depnar Bulrious says, 'Hail. Teddee! I am the master of the paladins among the Peacekeepers. Have you [joined] the harmony of the Peacekeepers or are you merely a visitor?'

'''Hand [[Depnar Bulrious]] [[a tattered note]].'''

:: ''A tattered note reads:''

:: <code>Come to the Temple of Light, in the city of Erudin. From the harbor, go through the entrance opposite of the boathouse, and then walk onto the blue teleport gem. Give this note to [[Depnar Bulrious]], and she will welcome you into the Followers of Quellious.</code>

: Depnar Bulrious says, 'Welcome to the Temple of Divine Light. I am Master Bulrious. Here, we study and spread the will of Quellious. Here is your guild tunic.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Peace Keepers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Council of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Heretics]] got worse.
